+++ b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7228.bugfix
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+Fix a crash when an invalid regular expression is used for a ``regexp`` or
+``regexp_csv`` option (for example in a configuration file). An error message
+is now emitted instead of a traceback.
+
+Closes #7228
